      "scene_id": "scene_1",
      "purpose": "Replace scanning with a lookup mechanism",
      "start_ms": 14000,
      "end_ms": 22000
    },
    {
      "text": "That shortcut has a trade-off: the index needs storage and updates when indexed values change.",
